  "about": "What the server (models.folds, in lower case) and the scan page (cart.bares) both make of each text, as searched: 'typed', folded as typed, units as they are, and 'searched', with its units respelt, the second form only where it differs; and what units.respell makes of it decomposed (NFKD), on both sides, reading its 'rules' first where it has them (reading rules, by a number and its unit as typed: the unit's symbol, or null, no unit): backend tests/test_units.py and frontend src/units.test.ts read it. A text with letters anyascii spells otherwise than decomposing, as Greek or Cyrillic, or signs, as °, has no 'typed', and no 'searched' where its respelt form has such: only what does is compared. 'groups' holds what units.groups and units.ts's groups make of each text decomposed (NFKD), its 'rules' first: each group as typed and respelt, none past the most matched (groups_max).",
